>> title: Horlicks
>> category: Drinks
>> tags: malt, evaporated milk, hong kong, hot, drink
>> counters: Cha Chaan Teng
>> aka: horlicks, holick, horlick, 好立克, hou laap hak, ovaltine, 阿華田, a wa tin, malted milk, hot malted milk, malt drink, hong kong horlicks
>> servings: 2
>> time: 10 min

>> step: stir it to a paste before the rest
Work @malted milk powder{4%Tbs}(28 g; Horlicks or Ovaltine) and @boiling water for the paste{2%Tbs}(30 mL) together in a warm #jug{} until there is not a lump left in it.

>> step: pour the rest of the water in
Pour @boiling water{1%cup}(240 mL) into @&(~1)malt paste{} and stir it out.

>> step: stir the milk and sugar in, pour it hot
Stir @evaporated milk{1/3%cup}(80 mL) and @granulated sugar{2%tsp}(to taste) through @&(~1)malt{} and pour it hot.
